---
// Support channel cards ported from the legacy gh-pages support section
// (task 21): anonymous Marshmallow box, public GitHub Issues, private mail.
---

<div class="card-grid card-grid-3">
  <a class="support-card" href="https://marshmallow-qa.com/blp4p7r8sz8lt2a" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-testid="support-marshmallow-link">
    <span class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M12 2 C6.5 2 2 6 2 11 c0 2.5 1.1 4.7 2.9 6.3 L4 22 l5.2 -2.5 c0.9 0.2 1.8 0.4 2.8 0.4 c5.5 0 10 -4 10 -9 s-4.5 -8.9 -10 -8.9 z" fill="#ff8ba7"></path>
        <circle cx="9" cy="11" r="1.3" fill="#fff"></circle>
        <circle cx="15" cy="11" r="1.3" fill="#fff"></circle>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="support-card-title">マシュマロ</span>
    <span class="support-card-desc">完全匿名で質問・要望を送れます。ログイン不要。感想なども気軽に送ってください。</span>
    <span class="support-card-tag">匿名OK</span>
  </a>

  <a class="support-card" href="https://github.com/sas-news/d-op/issues" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-testid="support-issues-link">
    <span class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M12 2 a10 10 0 0 0 -3.2 19.5 c0.5 0.1 0.7 -0.2 0.7 -0.5 v-1.7 c-2.8 0.6 -3.4 -1.4 -3.4 -1.4 c-0.5 -1.2 -1.1 -1.5 -1.1 -1.5 c-0.9 -0.6 0.1 -0.6 0.1 -0.6 c1 0.1 1.5 1 1.5 1 c0.9 1.5 2.4 1.1 3 0.8 c0.1 -0.6 0.4 -1.1 0.6 -1.3 c-2.2 -0.3 -4.6 -1.1 -4.6 -5 c0 -1.1 0.4 -2 1 -2.7 c-0.1 -0.3 -0.4 -1.3 0.1 -2.7 c0 0 0.8 -0.3 2.8 1 a9.6 9.6 0 0 1 5 0 c1.9 -1.3 2.8 -1 2.8 -1 c0.5 1.4 0.2 2.4 0.1 2.7 c0.6 0.7 1 1.6 1 2.7 c0 3.9 -2.3 4.7 -4.6 5 c0.4 0.3 0.7 0.9 0.7 1.8 v2.6 c0 0.3 0.2 0.6 0.7 0.5 A10 10 0 0 0 12 2 z" fill="#0a84ff"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="support-card-title">GitHub Issues</span>
    <span class="support-card-desc">Dev・バグ報告・機能提案はこちらから。公開されるので、似た議論を検索できます。</span>
    <span class="support-card-tag">公開</span>
  </a>

  <a class="support-card" href="mailto:contact@sasnews.dev" data-testid="support-mail-link">
    <span class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M3 6 h18 a1 1 0 0 1 1 1 v10 a1 1 0 0 1 -1 1 H3 a1 1 0 0 1 -1 -1 V7 a1 1 0 0 1 1 -1 z" fill="none" stroke="#30d158" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
        <path d="M3 7 l9 6 l9 -6" fill="none" stroke="#30d158" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="support-card-title">メール</span>
    <span class="support-card-desc">非公開で連絡したい場合にご利用ください。返信までお時間をいただく場合があります。</span>
    <span class="support-card-tag">非公開</span>
  </a>
</div>

<style>
  .card-grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .support-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color var(--motion-base),
      background-color var(--motion-base),
      transform var(--motion-base);
  }

  .support-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-info);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    transform: translateY(-0.125rem);
  }

  .support-card-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-line);
  }

  .support-card-title {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .support-card-desc {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .support-card-tag {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    padding: 0.125rem 0.625rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    transition:
      border-color var(--motion-fast),
      color var(--motion-fast);
  }

  .support-card:hover .support-card-tag {
    border-color: var(--color-info);
    color: var(--color-info);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .card-grid-3 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
